sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Data Scientist
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Webhook as Webhook Server<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant Controller as kserve-controller<br/>ServiceAccount Auth
    participant GW as Platform Gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Pod as Model Serving Pod<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant Storage as Storage Backend<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over User,Storage: Flow 1: InferenceService Deployment
        User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply InferenceService<br/>Bearer Token / kubeconfig
        K8sAPI->>Webhook: Admission review<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS, client cert
        Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Admit (mutate defaults)
        K8sAPI-->>User: Resource created
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Watch event received<br/>HTTPS/6443, ServiceAccount
        Controller->>Storage: Validate model path<br/>HTTPS/443, cloud credentials
        Storage-->>Controller: Model metadata
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create Deployment + Service<br/>HTTPS/6443, ServiceAccount
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create HTTPRoute<br/>HTTPS/6443, ServiceAccount
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create HPA / ScaledObject<br/>HTTPS/6443, ServiceAccount
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over User,Storage: Flow 2: Model Inference Request
        User->>GW: POST /v1/models/{model}:predict<br/>HTTPS/443, Bearer Token
        GW->>Pod: Forward request<br/>HTTP/8080, NetworkPolicy
        Pod-->>GW: Prediction response
        GW-->>User: JSON response
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over User,Storage: Flow 3: Local Model Caching
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create PV + PVC<br/>HTTPS/6443, ServiceAccount
        K8sAPI-->>Controller: PV/PVC created
        Note over Controller: LocalModelNode agent<br/>creates download Job
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create download Job<br/>HTTPS/6443, ServiceAccount
        K8sAPI-->>Controller: Job scheduled
        Note over Storage: Download Job pod
        Controller->>Storage: Download model artifacts<br/>HTTPS/443, storage credentials
        Storage-->>Controller: Model artifacts to PV
    end
